== Trivia ==
* The design of the Sacred Orb seems to be based upon a [[wikipedia:Globus cruciger|globus cruciger]], lit. "cross-bearing orb", a Christian symbol of authority.
* This item is a stronger version of {{C|Tainted Lost}}'s "better items" mechanic. Its unlock method is unusual, as most other tainted characters have items based on their unique mechanics unlocked by defeating {{E|Delirium}} instead of {{E|The Beast}}.

